From 216c1601468c9d80d48c229fe2bc393544d21859 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cline <cline@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 12:13:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wire in GitHub Pages PR preview workflows

- .github/workflows/deploy.yml: publishes main to the gh-pages branch root
  on every push (excludes .github from the published site; clean-exclude
  protects pr-preview/ so production deploys never delete previews)
- .github/workflows/preview.yml: deploys every PR to
  gh-pages/pr-preview/pr-<number>/ via rossjrw/pr-preview-action, posts a
  sticky comment with the preview URL, refreshes on new commits, and
  removes the preview when the PR closes
- Removes static.yml (replaced by deploy.yml)
- README and docs/pr-previews.md updated: workflows are now wired in;
  only the two one-time repo settings remain (Pages source = Deploy from
  branch gh-pages; workflow permissions = read/write)
